{
  "date": "2026-01-31",
  "period_start": "2026-01-01",
  "period_end": "2026-01-31",
  "title": "The app garden grew into a proper ecosystem map",
  "summary": "January expanded the app garden and model toolbox while making Pollinations easier to integrate, inspect, and trust under real traffic.\n\nThe Apps directory absorbed a large crop of community projects across creative tools, chat, education, games, bots, and developer tooling, with improved submissions, categories, issue tracking, and regularly refreshed app stats.\n\nVisionAI, Onyx, NomNom, Kimi K2.5, klein-large, Gemini Legacy, Wan 2.6, SANA-Sprint, Flux, Klein, and new Fireworks models broadened the unified endpoints for chat, images, research, and video; Play also gained audio generation.\n\nA Pollinations provider for the Vercel AI SDK, BYOP support in chat, improved OpenAI-compatible routing, canonical model docs, richer schemas, and better model picker guidance reduced the amount of integration archaeology required.\n\nAuthorization and account permissions were refined, usage and service dashboards gained visibility, API key status and error responses became more specific, and high-volume keys reached 10,000 requests per second.",
  "pr_count": 352,
